1
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,980
How long are you gonna stay here, Dad?

2
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:20,730
I dunno. You'd be sad if I left, right, Sota?

3
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:21,900
Gotta pee!

4
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,270
Mmkay, don't fall in!

5
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:29,560
I'm wondering the same thing, sweetheart.
How long are you staying?

6
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:31,770
Why're you asking?

7
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:36,480
Yuriko... do I not have a home here?

8
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:41,230
I'm just wondering if your <i>job</i> is
okay with you being here so long.

9
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:45,400
I'm back. Kyosuke, Miyamura's here.

10
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,100
Whoa, really?!

11
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:49,560
Thank you for having me.

12
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,150
Who the hell are you?

13
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:54,190
It's your best buddy, Miyamura.

14
00:00:54,190 --> 00:00:57,650
Um, uh...

15
00:00:57,650 --> 00:01:00,060
Th-Thank you for having me...

16
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:02,270
Hot damn, it <i>is</i> you!

17
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:04,940
Yes, it's me.

18
00:01:04,940 --> 00:01:07,770
C'mon, it's hot enough without
you smothering him. Get off.

19
00:01:07,770 --> 00:01:12,150
Damn, you sure are sweating hard.
Makes sense with the summer heat.

20
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:14,020
Yes, right...

21
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:15,230
It's actually a cold sweat.

22
00:01:15,230 --> 00:01:16,900
I got an idea, Miyamura- <i>kun</i> !

23
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:18,060
Yes, sir?

24
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:20,310
You should take a bath with me!

25
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:21,770
Wait, what?!

26
00:01:21,770 --> 00:01:24,650
I've already filled the bath.
Feel free to jump in.

27
00:01:24,650 --> 00:01:26,730
It'll be a while before dinner is ready.

28
00:01:26,730 --> 00:01:28,310
Oh, no thank you.

29
00:01:28,310 --> 00:01:29,690
You don't wanna bathe with me?

30
00:01:29,690 --> 00:01:31,980
Huh? No, that's not it.

31
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:35,850
Really? Sweet, let's hop in!

32
00:01:35,850 --> 00:01:41,350
Aww, don't be shy, it'll be fun!

33
00:01:36,770 --> 00:01:39,520
Aww, c'mon. Don't be shy.

34
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:42,810
U-Umm, sir, could I...?

35
00:01:44,690 --> 00:01:47,310
K-Kyosuke- <i>san</i> ! Please don't freak out!

36
00:01:47,310 --> 00:01:49,900
These aren't yakuza tattoos, I swear!

37
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:51,690
Oh, right.

38
00:01:51,690 --> 00:01:54,690
I know this is gonna be a dumb question,

39
00:01:54,690 --> 00:01:56,730
but these are disposable chopsticks, right?

40
00:01:56,730 --> 00:01:58,690
You ate dinner with them and you just noticed?

41
00:01:58,690 --> 00:02:01,560
But Miyamura- <i>kun</i> 's got part of a matching set.

42
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:03,060
I'm so sorry.

43
00:02:03,060 --> 00:02:06,810
Oh, it's getting late! I'm sorry
for overstaying my welcome.

44
00:02:06,810 --> 00:02:08,940
Might as well just stay the night.

45
00:02:08,940 --> 00:02:11,350
Huh?! Thanks for the offer, but I shouldn't...

46
00:02:11,350 --> 00:02:15,900
If Izumi- <i>kun</i> sleeps over, we won't
have a futon for you, sweetheart!

47
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:19,440
Why's it his?! And why
does <i>he</i> get priority over <i>me</i> ?!

48
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:21,310
Are you gonna sleep over?!

49
00:02:21,310 --> 00:02:22,940
I wouldn't want to impose...

50
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:25,150
Ooh, ooh! You can sleep in my room!

51
00:02:25,150 --> 00:02:28,060
No! Miyamura- <i>kun</i> 's gonna sleep with Daddy!

52
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:29,980
Awww!

53
00:02:31,850 --> 00:02:33,600
Mmkay, goodnight.

54
00:02:34,350 --> 00:02:37,730
Sorry you've gotta share
a room with this old fart.

55
00:02:37,730 --> 00:02:38,770
It's all right.

56
00:02:38,770 --> 00:02:40,770
Bet you wish you were in Kyoko's room.

57
00:02:40,770 --> 00:02:43,650
Oh, no, no, no!

58
00:02:45,020 --> 00:02:49,350
So, Miyamura- <i>kun</i> .
What do you like about my daughter?

59
00:02:52,810 --> 00:02:54,600
I like...

60
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:57,650
...how she doesn't judge people by appearances.

61
00:03:01,940 --> 00:03:04,650
K-Kyosuke- <i>san</i> ?

62
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:08,480
He passed out!

63
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:31,810
Horimiya

64
00:04:47,890 --> 00:04:52,060
This Summer's Going to Be a Hot One

65
00:04:51,350 --> 00:04:52,940
Feels like I barely got any sleep.

66
00:04:52,940 --> 00:04:54,560
Morning.

67
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,810
Hey, g'morning.

68
00:05:02,650 --> 00:05:05,940
She's wearing her middle-school gym clothes.

69
00:05:05,940 --> 00:05:07,690
See you later!

70
00:05:07,690 --> 00:05:09,850
Have a good day at school!

71
00:05:09,850 --> 00:05:12,060
Want me to walk you there?

72
00:05:12,060 --> 00:05:13,980
Follow me and you're dead.

73
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:15,060
See you later!

74
00:05:15,060 --> 00:05:16,900
Thank you again.

75
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:18,520
Izumi- <i>kun</i> .

76
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:23,270
When you leave home in the morning,
you should say "see you later."

77
00:05:23,270 --> 00:05:25,600
S-See you later!

78
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,850
I hope we do.

79
00:05:32,230 --> 00:05:36,560
Hold up... Did they just
come out of the same house?

80
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:42,600
Holy shit, Hori from Class 1?!
I thought she was single!

81
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:45,190
Hori? You have elective with her, right?

82
00:05:45,190 --> 00:05:48,940
She's super smart, and pretty cute, too.

83
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:50,020
Yeah?

84
00:05:50,020 --> 00:05:53,100
Why the hell is she dating Miyamura?

85
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:55,940
It's crazy! Hell, I'd be
a way better match for her!

86
00:05:55,940 --> 00:05:58,940
I hear Hori- <i>san</i> 's dating Miyamura- <i>kun</i> !

87
00:05:58,940 --> 00:06:00,270
For real?!

88
00:06:00,270 --> 00:06:04,190
That emo-looking guy?! Oh my God,
what's <i>wrong</i> with her?!

89
00:06:04,190 --> 00:06:07,020
Talk about terrible taste!

90
00:06:09,650 --> 00:06:11,980
They're all talking shit about
them behind their backs!

91
00:06:11,980 --> 00:06:15,190
And they're probably hearing it, too.

92
00:06:15,190 --> 00:06:17,730
Well, yeah! They were yapping
about it in the same damn room!

93
00:06:17,730 --> 00:06:21,480
Even people from other classes
are joining in on it, too. Assholes!

94
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:26,940
I know. Just when Miyamura
had finally gotten there...

95
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:31,270
What?! Why are <i>you</i> crying, Yoshikawa?!

96
00:06:31,270 --> 00:06:35,440
There, there, it's okay.

97
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:39,560
Hey, Hori. Are you really dating Miyamura?

98
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,940
Yeah, why?

99
00:06:40,940 --> 00:06:45,440
No way! Bet all the guys you rejected
are crying about that right now!

100
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:47,270
I didn't turn down that many, you know.

101
00:06:47,270 --> 00:06:50,270
C'mon, don't get all humble on us, Hori- <i>san</i> .

102
00:06:50,270 --> 00:06:54,400
Don't pay attention to them,
Miyamura. They're all idiots.

103
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:57,230
I told Hori this, too, but keep your chin up!

104
00:06:57,230 --> 00:07:00,900
It's fine, Miyamura. I don't really care.

105
00:07:07,730 --> 00:07:10,770
Aww, where's your hubby?

106
00:07:10,770 --> 00:07:12,560
I dunno.

107
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,980
Oh, shit, is he skipping school?

108
00:07:14,980 --> 00:07:16,150
Ow!

109
00:07:16,150 --> 00:07:18,150
He'll be here after lunch.

110
00:07:18,150 --> 00:07:20,350
What the hell, Ishikawa?

111
00:07:39,350 --> 00:07:41,310
Morning.

112
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:45,940
What?!

113
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:49,100
Miyamura- <i>kun</i> ! Why'd you cut your hair?

114
00:07:49,100 --> 00:07:52,600
Oh, I mean, it's summer.

115
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,400
He cut it 'cause it's summer!

116
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:55,770
Cool!

117
00:07:55,770 --> 00:07:58,270
Hey, why are you still
wearing your winter uniform?

118
00:07:58,270 --> 00:08:00,190
I-I get cold.

119
00:08:00,190 --> 00:08:03,850
Wow, your piercings are so cool!
When did you get them?

120
00:08:03,850 --> 00:08:04,980
Middle school.

121
00:08:04,980 --> 00:08:07,850
Your family runs a bakery, right?

122
00:08:07,850 --> 00:08:11,690
Holy crap... Talk about a cold glare!

123
00:08:12,810 --> 00:08:14,480
I'm kind of cold...

124
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:16,350
Wow, me, too...

125
00:08:16,350 --> 00:08:18,230
This probably won't last long.

126
00:08:18,230 --> 00:08:20,980
Huh? What won't? What're you talking about?

127
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:22,900
Why is it so cold in here?!

128
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:27,020
'Sup, Miyamura? How's it hangin'?

129
00:08:32,060 --> 00:08:36,400
Shu, you win the award for Best Reaction.

130
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:40,400
Oh, it's just you, Miyamura! You cut your hair.

131
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:42,150
Changing things up for summer?

132
00:08:42,150 --> 00:08:43,440
Yeah, thanks.

133
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:46,350
Summer is a good time for that kind of stuff.

134
00:08:46,350 --> 00:08:46,980
Huh?

135
00:08:46,980 --> 00:08:49,020
That chick just took a picture.

136
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:50,190
I'll text it to you!

137
00:08:50,190 --> 00:08:52,940
Ugh, that's so gross.

138
00:08:52,940 --> 00:08:54,770
Hey, Hori--

139
00:08:54,770 --> 00:08:57,350
C'mon, don't try to outdo them!

140
00:08:58,560 --> 00:09:00,850
Dad! Dad, check out his hair!

141
00:09:00,850 --> 00:09:02,940
Thanks for havi--

142
00:09:02,940 --> 00:09:04,850
Who the hell are you?

143
00:09:04,850 --> 00:09:07,850
You're can't recognize your
best buddy after a haircut?

144
00:09:07,850 --> 00:09:11,600
Whoa, Miyamura- <i>kun</i> ?! What a transformation!

145
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:13,650
Did you get dumped or something?! Chin up, man!

146
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:16,230
If I'd dumped him, I wouldn't bring him over!

147
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:16,990
Shindo

148
00:09:16,990 --> 00:09:17,070
Shindo

149
00:09:17,070 --> 00:09:17,160
Shindo

150
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:17,240
Shindo

151
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:17,320
Shindo

152
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,570
Shindo

153
00:09:18,770 --> 00:09:19,810
Who's that?

154
00:09:19,810 --> 00:09:21,020
Another girl?

155
00:09:21,020 --> 00:09:23,600
No, a friend of mine...

156
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:26,100
What do <i>you</i> want?

157
00:09:26,100 --> 00:09:27,690
Candy?

158
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,250
"Citrus"

159
00:09:31,100 --> 00:09:33,310
Whoa, there...

160
00:09:36,850 --> 00:09:40,100
Sorry we're late.

161
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,900
What're you doing?

162
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,480
What's wrong with you?!

163
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:53,310
Miyamura! You've, you've...

164
00:09:52,610 --> 00:09:56,740
My Miyamura

165
00:09:57,270 --> 00:09:57,270
My sweet, precious Miyamura!
He's gone, gone forever!

166
00:09:57,270 --> 00:09:58,730
I don't belong to you.

167
00:09:58,730 --> 00:10:02,060
C'mon, Shindo- <i>kun</i> , his hair'll grow back.

168
00:10:01,490 --> 00:10:05,000
"Durian"

169
00:10:02,060 --> 00:10:05,480
Damn, this is a huge bag. Is it all just candy?

170
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,900
Yeah. I won an online contest.

171
00:10:07,900 --> 00:10:11,020
I gave a bunch out to
people in my class already.

172
00:10:11,020 --> 00:10:13,310
Hori- <i>san</i> , what flavor do you like?

173
00:10:13,310 --> 00:10:15,190
I'll take whatever.

174
00:10:15,190 --> 00:10:17,730
I've got pomegranate and fig.

175
00:10:17,730 --> 00:10:19,400
Do you have any strawberry?

176
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:23,400
No, Chika took all the normal flavors with her.

177
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:25,560
So now you've just got the weird ones.

178
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:28,270
Which flavor is that one, Hori- <i>san</i> ?

179
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:30,190
Let's see...

180
00:10:31,730 --> 00:10:32,980
Cheese?

181
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:37,440
Cheese? You don't like cheese, right, Shindo?

182
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:41,730
Hell no. I'd rather throw my wallet
in a ditch than choke down cheese.

183
00:10:41,730 --> 00:10:43,480
Right.

184
00:10:45,730 --> 00:10:49,270
Say, "ahh."

185
00:10:49,270 --> 00:10:51,980
Miyamura's feeding me candy!

186
00:10:51,980 --> 00:10:54,060
This may never happen again!

187
00:10:54,060 --> 00:10:57,480
But it's cheese flavor... <i>Cheese flavor</i> !

188
00:11:00,060 --> 00:11:03,310
Are these guys really friends?

189
00:11:03,310 --> 00:11:04,190
Is it good?

190
00:11:04,190 --> 00:11:06,850
You know it's not, asshole!

191
00:11:06,850 --> 00:11:08,230
You big meanie!

192
00:11:08,230 --> 00:11:09,980
Which flavor's that one?

193
00:11:09,980 --> 00:11:12,190
Huh? Uh, clay?

194
00:11:12,190 --> 00:11:13,270
Clay?!

195
00:11:13,270 --> 00:11:15,100
It's really bitter.

196
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:22,440
Huh?

197
00:11:26,690 --> 00:11:29,480
Miyamura, could you get me some water?

198
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,060
You're such a pain.

199
00:11:31,060 --> 00:11:34,520
Hey! You're the one who made me eat it!

200
00:11:36,650 --> 00:11:38,400
What's up, Hori- <i>san</i> ?

201
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:40,560
He stole my candy.

202
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:45,150
Aww, what flavor was it? I have a bunch more.

203
00:11:45,150 --> 00:11:46,940
I-I'm good, thanks!

204
00:11:46,940 --> 00:11:50,600
Okay, then you should give this flavor a try!

205
00:11:56,100 --> 00:11:59,940
She's right. It tastes like clay.

206
00:11:59,940 --> 00:12:03,020
The girls've stopped
coming around to bother you.

207
00:12:03,020 --> 00:12:05,400
Guess the novelty wore off.

208
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:08,560
Honestly, it's a big relief...

209
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:10,560
What the...? Do you know her?

210
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:13,770
No, I don't think I do.

211
00:12:13,770 --> 00:12:16,520
Why was she glaring at me?

212
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:18,690
Why was she glaring at you?

213
00:12:18,690 --> 00:12:20,850
No idea.

214
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:28,440
We were watching TV when it came on
out of nowhere! We were so freaked...

215
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:30,060
What's up, Hori?

216
00:12:30,060 --> 00:12:32,350
Oh, nothing, just...

217
00:12:32,350 --> 00:12:33,560
Hori- <i>senpai</i> !

218
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:34,480
Who're you?!

219
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:37,310
Are you Miyamura- <i>senpai</i> 's girlfriend?

220
00:12:37,310 --> 00:12:40,480
Well, yeah.

221
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:42,600
And?

222
00:12:43,940 --> 00:12:46,230
Sorry to bother you!

223
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:05,810
Okay, she's really freaking me out here!

224
00:13:07,730 --> 00:13:09,480
Hey.

225
00:13:11,900 --> 00:13:15,100
So, uh...

226
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:17,100
When are you breaking up with her?!

227
00:13:17,100 --> 00:13:17,940
Huh?

228
00:13:17,940 --> 00:13:21,020
When are you breaking up with Hori- <i>senpai</i> ?!

229
00:13:21,020 --> 00:13:22,350
Wait, what?

230
00:13:22,350 --> 00:13:23,270
Is he two-timing her?

231
00:13:23,270 --> 00:13:24,650
Wait, no!

232
00:13:24,650 --> 00:13:27,730
When are you breaking up with her?!

233
00:13:27,730 --> 00:13:29,600
Never!

234
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:35,480
I'm Honoka Sawada from
Class 2-5, and I'll be back!

235
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:37,730
You really don't have to come back.

236
00:13:37,730 --> 00:13:39,810
I will!

237
00:13:39,810 --> 00:13:41,730
What the hell...?

238
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:46,600
So she's a second-year, huh.

239
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:50,850
She comes to stalk me on every break.

240
00:13:50,850 --> 00:13:52,850
What's her name again?

241
00:13:52,850 --> 00:13:54,650
Honoka Sawada!

242
00:13:54,650 --> 00:13:55,480
See?!

243
00:13:55,480 --> 00:14:00,980
Okay, what do you want?
Why do you keep following him around?

244
00:14:00,980 --> 00:14:03,190
I-I just...

245
00:14:03,190 --> 00:14:04,310
You just <i>what</i> ?!

246
00:14:04,310 --> 00:14:06,100
Hori- <i>san</i> !

247
00:14:06,100 --> 00:14:08,980
I can't help it! I like you so much!

248
00:14:08,980 --> 00:14:13,060
I had no idea you were taken!

249
00:14:13,060 --> 00:14:17,900
He's so lanky and has so many
piercings! Why do you like him?!

250
00:14:17,900 --> 00:14:22,270
I had a crush on you <i>first</i> , Hori- <i>senpai</i> !

251
00:14:23,770 --> 00:14:25,980
What a twist!

252
00:14:25,980 --> 00:14:27,100
Ishikawa- <i>kun</i> !

253
00:14:27,100 --> 00:14:30,270
Sorry, I was listening in
'cause it looked hilarious.

254
00:14:30,270 --> 00:14:33,900
Hey, quit it! Can you do something about her?!

255
00:14:33,900 --> 00:14:37,020
Hey, uh, Sawada- <i>san</i> ? Could you let go of--

256
00:14:37,020 --> 00:14:39,520
Shut it, you no-good punk.

257
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:41,770
Huh? What'd you say I am?

258
00:14:41,770 --> 00:14:43,440
A punk.

259
00:14:49,070 --> 00:14:51,820
"Yoshikawa, come to the entrance.
You gotta see this."

260
00:14:49,150 --> 00:14:50,400
Let go of her!

261
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:51,480
No!

262
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:51,900
No!

263
00:14:51,620 --> 00:14:51,820
"SENT"

264
00:14:51,900 --> 00:14:54,770
Sawada- <i>san</i> , if you were a guy,
I would've headbutted you by now!

265
00:14:54,770 --> 00:14:57,190
I like her more than you! I <i>love</i> her!

266
00:14:57,190 --> 00:14:59,810
Why do you even like this guy, Hori- <i>senpai</i> ?!

267
00:14:59,810 --> 00:15:02,650
Um... Let me think for a second.

268
00:15:02,650 --> 00:15:05,150
You have to think about it?!

269
00:15:09,020 --> 00:15:11,310
She's <i>mine</i> !

270
00:15:11,310 --> 00:15:15,270
Took you long enough, Yoshikawa.
The show's practically over.

271
00:15:15,270 --> 00:15:19,400
I dunno, this is still pretty damn funny.

272
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:24,100
Hori- <i>senpai</i> ! I made these in home ec!

273
00:15:24,100 --> 00:15:27,060
Get your paws off her, Sawada.

274
00:15:27,060 --> 00:15:29,100
There they go again...

275
00:15:29,100 --> 00:15:31,150
Shut up, Miyamura! Shut your piehole!

276
00:15:31,150 --> 00:15:32,650
I'm not shutting <i>anything</i> !

277
00:15:32,650 --> 00:15:36,560
Hori- <i>senpai</i> told me I could still talk to her!

278
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:38,440
Right, Hori- <i>senpai</i> ?

279
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:41,440
Y-Yeah, I said that...

280
00:15:44,310 --> 00:15:46,940
That's the bell! Let's get back to class!

281
00:15:46,940 --> 00:15:48,600
Hey!

282
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:49,900
Hori- <i>san</i> !

283
00:15:49,900 --> 00:15:53,810
Please listen to your <i>boyfriend</i> .
Let's go back to class.

284
00:15:53,810 --> 00:15:55,690
O-Okay.

285
00:15:55,690 --> 00:15:59,150
Senpai!

286
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:03,400
Miyamura!

287
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:05,230
Sawada, you freaking--

288
00:16:05,230 --> 00:16:07,810
You have to stop popping in out of nowhere!

289
00:16:07,810 --> 00:16:09,730
Where's Hori- <i>senpai</i> ?

290
00:16:09,730 --> 00:16:12,560
She went home early to get some stuff done.

291
00:16:14,270 --> 00:16:16,600
Guess I'll go home, too.

292
00:16:30,270 --> 00:16:32,480
Why're you going this way?!

293
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:34,730
Why're <i>you</i> going this way?!

294
00:16:48,690 --> 00:16:50,150
Are you kidding me?!

295
00:16:50,150 --> 00:16:51,940
O-Oh, come on!

296
00:16:51,940 --> 00:16:54,400
What kind of whacky coincidence <i>is</i> this?

297
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:59,810
Oh, jeez, I left the key inside...

298
00:17:02,190 --> 00:17:04,400
Thanks for the cake!

299
00:17:07,060 --> 00:17:08,900
Wow, it's so good!

300
00:17:08,900 --> 00:17:12,270
Do you just let anyone and everyone
into your place, Miyamura?

301
00:17:12,270 --> 00:17:16,980
No, not just anyone. Hori- <i>san</i>
doesn't even come over that often.

302
00:17:16,980 --> 00:17:18,730
Wow.

303
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:24,810
Maybe things aren't going as well as I thought!

304
00:17:24,810 --> 00:17:28,400
No, I just always go over to her place.

305
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:30,100
Oh.

306
00:17:30,100 --> 00:17:33,100
So, Miyamura, do you have any siblings?

307
00:17:33,100 --> 00:17:37,190
Nope, it's just me, my mom, and my dad.

308
00:17:37,190 --> 00:17:40,520
I totally assumed you had
a little brother or sister.

309
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:41,770
Why?

310
00:17:41,770 --> 00:17:44,190
'Cause you're good at taking care of people.

311
00:17:46,230 --> 00:17:48,940
What?

312
00:17:48,940 --> 00:17:51,690
Why're you laughing?!

313
00:17:53,190 --> 00:17:54,940
Oh, man.

314
00:17:54,940 --> 00:17:56,520
Honoka.

315
00:17:59,850 --> 00:18:02,270
You know, I...

316
00:18:02,270 --> 00:18:04,520
I had an older brother.

317
00:18:04,520 --> 00:18:07,650
Huh?

318
00:18:07,650 --> 00:18:12,940
He was a year older than me.

319
00:18:12,940 --> 00:18:16,230
Just kidding! I made it all up!

320
00:18:16,230 --> 00:18:17,520
What?!

321
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:20,480
C'mon, I'm just joking around!

322
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:22,940
Oh, they're home!

323
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:25,480
Thanks again for the cake. See you later!

324
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,980
Hey, Sawada?

325
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:30,230
You can come over for cake whenever you want.

326
00:18:30,230 --> 00:18:31,560
Thanks.

327
00:18:36,650 --> 00:18:40,480
Yes, that did happen to the Sawadas next door.

328
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:43,690
It's so sad that they had
to lose their eldest like that.

329
00:18:43,690 --> 00:18:47,480
You probably didn't see him much,
since he went to a different school.

330
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:48,940
When'd he die?

331
00:18:48,940 --> 00:18:52,600
Last year in... I don't remember when.

332
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:54,980
Such a nice boy.

333
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:57,600
Huh.

334
00:18:57,600 --> 00:18:59,850
Her older brother...

335
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:04,560
Who're you waiting for, Sawada- <i>san</i> ?

336
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:06,100
A friend.

337
00:19:06,100 --> 00:19:09,230
Yeah, right! You're trying to
ambush Hori- <i>san</i> ! Go home!

338
00:19:09,230 --> 00:19:13,270
Who do you think you are?!
You're not the boss of me!

339
00:19:14,350 --> 00:19:16,190
Hey.

340
00:19:16,190 --> 00:19:17,480
You free right now?

341
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:19,480
You're so short. First-year?

342
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:21,810
Wow, she got quiet.

343
00:19:21,810 --> 00:19:22,650
You scared of us?

344
00:19:22,650 --> 00:19:24,100
We're not scary.

345
00:19:24,100 --> 00:19:26,520
C'mon, say something.

346
00:19:26,520 --> 00:19:28,270
At least tell us what your first name is!

347
00:19:28,270 --> 00:19:30,310
C'mon, what's your name?

348
00:19:37,770 --> 00:19:40,400
Hey, uh... wanna head home?

349
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:42,190
Yeah.

350
00:19:42,190 --> 00:19:44,350
Good idea.

351
00:19:46,400 --> 00:19:49,560
I was just trying to think of what to say...

352
00:19:49,560 --> 00:19:53,060
Do guys make you uncomfortable, Sawada?

353
00:19:53,060 --> 00:19:54,310
Kinda.

354
00:19:54,310 --> 00:19:57,480
You know, I'm <i>also</i> a guy...

355
00:19:57,480 --> 00:20:00,810
Man, Hori- <i>senpai</i> sure is late!

356
00:20:00,810 --> 00:20:02,480
I knew it!

357
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:05,100
Sorry that took so long!

358
00:20:05,100 --> 00:20:08,850
I've taken a bath at Hori- <i>san</i> 's house!

359
00:20:08,850 --> 00:20:11,480
What?! Then I'm gonna do that, too!

360
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:12,310
You're not allowed!

361
00:20:12,310 --> 00:20:15,020
Says you!

362
00:20:15,020 --> 00:20:17,560
S-Someone, help...

363
00:20:15,900 --> 00:20:19,020
Can we finish watching this later?

364
00:20:19,020 --> 00:20:21,400
No, I gotta return it tomorrow.

365
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:23,900
Horror movies <i>really</i> freak me out.

366
00:20:23,900 --> 00:20:26,770
I can't believe my own daughter
would bully me like this...

367
00:20:26,770 --> 00:20:29,400
It's okay, they scare me, too.

368
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:33,940
This whole series is about a girl
planning to murder her father!

369
00:20:33,940 --> 00:20:36,650
You're reading too much into this.

370
00:20:36,650 --> 00:20:39,440
Do you really like this movie that much, Hori?

371
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:43,440
Man, I <i>so</i> relate to this main character.

372
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:45,400
Their relationship's a lost cause.

373
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:47,770
All this time, I sucked it up and took it.

374
00:20:47,770 --> 00:20:51,270
But not anymore!

375
00:20:51,270 --> 00:20:56,100
I'm gonna go buy smokes!
Don't come looking for me!

376
00:21:00,850 --> 00:21:02,350
Hey, Miyamura.

377
00:21:02,350 --> 00:21:05,150
You never make any moves on me, huh.

378
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:10,650
Huh? What?

379
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:19,150
Do you want me to?

380
00:21:24,980 --> 00:21:28,940
She's the one who said it,
but now she's all embarrassed.

381
00:21:30,810 --> 00:21:32,190
What's so funny?!

382
00:21:32,190 --> 00:21:35,650
Nothing, just thought
you were being really cute.

383
00:21:35,650 --> 00:21:37,400
What?!

384
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:41,810
Hori- <i>san</i> , what kind of moves
do you want me to make?

385
00:21:41,810 --> 00:21:48,060
W-Well, I...

386
00:21:48,060 --> 00:21:48,900
Miya--

387
00:21:48,900 --> 00:21:51,940
Kyoko- <i>chan</i> ! You got any change?

388
00:21:53,520 --> 00:21:56,650
Man, how embarrassing!
I totally forgot my wallet!

389
00:21:58,900 --> 00:22:00,350
What's up, Kyoko?

390
00:22:00,350 --> 00:22:04,520
Ow, ow! Owie!

391
00:22:04,520 --> 00:22:08,310
What, did I interrupt something
goin' on in here? Am I a third wheel?

392
00:22:08,310 --> 00:22:10,650
Yes.

393
00:22:10,650 --> 00:22:14,190
Let's reenact that scene from the movie.

394
00:22:14,190 --> 00:22:16,650
Miyamura- <i>kun</i> , help me!

395
00:22:16,650 --> 00:22:20,850
We're gonna marathon all
three movies! No bathroom breaks!

396
00:23:48,610 --> 00:23:52,030
You're Here, I'm Here

